  <strong>Grow Commands</strong><br>
  These growth commands will help the user in understanding the state of business including sales and marketing.
  
  <strong>1. Sales Funnel:</strong> Command to view the sales funnel of all opportunities on weekly and quarterly basis.<br>
  Usage: /grow sales funnel

  <strong>2. Sales Funnel Drill Down:</strong> To drill down on all opportunities and the total forecast for a given month, week or quarter.<br>
  Usage: /grow sales funnel [pipeline | commit | upside | strong_upside | won | lost | forecast | open_forecast] [<year/month/end_of_week> | <year/month> | <year/quarter>]<br>
  Examples: <br>
  /grow sales funnel pipeline 2023/10/01<br>
  /grow sales funnel upside 2023/10<br>
  /grow sales funnel strong_upside 2023/Q3<br>
  /grow sales funnel won 2023/09/01<br>
  /grow sales funnel won 2023/Q3

  <strong>3. Sales Outbound:</strong> Command to view all first meetings, opportunities created and closed on weekly and quarterly basis.<br>
  Usage: /grow sales outbound

  <strong>4. Sales Outbound Drill Down:</strong> To drill down on all first meetings, opportunity created and closed for a given month, week or quarter.<br>
  Usage: /grow sales outbound [meeting_booked| meeting_scheduled | opp_created | opp_closed_won | opp_closed_lost] [<year/month/end_of_week> | <year/month> | <year/quarter>]<br>
  Examples: <br>
  /grow sales outbound meeting_booked 2023/10/08<br>
  /grow sales outbound meeting_booked 2023/08<br>
  /grow sales outbound meeting_scheduled 2023/10/01<br>
  /grow sales outbound opp_created 2023/Q3<br>
  /grow sales outbound opp_closed_won 2023/09/01<br>
  /grow sales outbound opp_closed_lost 2023/10/01
  
  <strong>5. Account Outbound:</strong> This command gives a view of all accounts for a given tag, along with first meeting scheduled and opportunity created if any.<br>
  Usage: /grow account outbound [tag_name]<br>
  Example: <br>
  /grow account outbound Saastr

  <strong>6. Marketing Touchpoints:</strong> This command gives an overview on number of touchpoints across various marketing sources, on weekly and quarterly basis.<br>
  Usage: /grow marketing touchpoints

  <strong>7. Marketing Touchpoints Drilldown:</strong> To view a summary touchpoints for a set of domains, users belonging to a particular domain and a complete drilldown on user to view
  each and every touchpoint .<br>
  Usage: /grow marketing [domain_summary | user_summary | user_touchpoints] [domain_name | user_name] <br>
  Examples: <br>
  /grow marketing domain_summary<br>
  /grow marketing user_summary rocketreach.com<br>
